# Title: Specialist Board Chain
# Summary: A paper-oriented specialist-review benchmark where a growing medical board evaluates each case before passing a treatment decision downstream.
# Benchmark Family: specialist_board_chain
# Board_1_1: Specialist reviewer 1 evaluates the case at board stage 1.
# Board_1_2: Specialist reviewer 2 evaluates the case at board stage 1.
# Board_1_3: Specialist reviewer 3 evaluates the case at board stage 1.
# Board_1_4: Specialist reviewer 4 evaluates the case at board stage 1.
# Board_1_5: Specialist reviewer 5 evaluates the case at board stage 1.
# Board_2_1: Specialist reviewer 1 evaluates the case at board stage 2.
# Board_2_2: Specialist reviewer 2 evaluates the case at board stage 2.
# Board_2_3: Specialist reviewer 3 evaluates the case at board stage 2.
# Board_2_4: Specialist reviewer 4 evaluates the case at board stage 2.
# Board_2_5: Specialist reviewer 5 evaluates the case at board stage 2.
# Board_3_1: Specialist reviewer 1 evaluates the case at board stage 3.
# Board_3_2: Specialist reviewer 2 evaluates the case at board stage 3.
# Board_3_3: Specialist reviewer 3 evaluates the case at board stage 3.
# Board_3_4: Specialist reviewer 4 evaluates the case at board stage 3.
# Board_3_5: Specialist reviewer 5 evaluates the case at board stage 3.
# Board_4_1: Specialist reviewer 1 evaluates the case at board stage 4.
# Board_4_2: Specialist reviewer 2 evaluates the case at board stage 4.
# Board_4_3: Specialist reviewer 3 evaluates the case at board stage 4.
# Board_4_4: Specialist reviewer 4 evaluates the case at board stage 4.
# Board_4_5: Specialist reviewer 5 evaluates the case at board stage 4.
# Board_5_1: Specialist reviewer 1 evaluates the case at board stage 5.
# Board_5_2: Specialist reviewer 2 evaluates the case at board stage 5.
# Board_5_3: Specialist reviewer 3 evaluates the case at board stage 5.
# Board_5_4: Specialist reviewer 4 evaluates the case at board stage 5.
# Board_5_5: Specialist reviewer 5 evaluates the case at board stage 5.
# Case_1: A patient case enters specialist board stage 1.
# Case_2: A patient case enters specialist board stage 2.
# Case_3: A patient case enters specialist board stage 3.
# Case_4: A patient case enters specialist board stage 4.
# Case_5: A patient case enters specialist board stage 5.
# Decision_1: Specialist board stage 1 reaches a treatment decision.
# Decision_2: Specialist board stage 2 reaches a treatment decision.
# Decision_3: Specialist board stage 3 reaches a treatment decision.
# Decision_4: Specialist board stage 4 reaches a treatment decision.
# Decision_5: Specialist board stage 5 reaches a treatment decision.

